# Refused by default (issue #200): a builder, a remote one included, receives only what the
# Dockerfile copies, so .git/, .venv/, temp/ and reports/ (personal data), tests/, docs/ and infra/
# never leave the machine. The build backend packs every file of src/k_b/: secrets, databases and
# caches left in src/ are refused as well.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
**/.env*
**/*.sqlite*
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
